tment  responded to a fire here  at the eli at fort apache apartment  complex construction site  at 50 55 south at fort apache road  atf special agents responded later to  the scene to provide investigative  support  and assistance as the scene  investigation progressed  the clark county fire department  requested we provide  additional resources and as a result  atf's national  response team or nrt was deployed  the nrt is composed of experienced  special agents  and personnel including certified fire  investigators  forensic mapping specialists accelerant  detection  canine teams fire protection engineers  electrical engineers forensic chemists  and certified explosive specialists  this nrt response provided 25 additional  personnel from around the country  together the clark county fire  department the nrt  and special agents from the san  francisco field divisions las vegas  field offices  have worked diligently to determine the  cause of this fire  a thorough examination of the scene was  conducted  and included documenting the fire scene  as well as searching through and  examining fire debris  in an effort to identify the cause and  origin of the fire  at this time we've concluded our scene  investigation  however atf and our partners are  continuing to investigate  we are following up on leads including  conducting numerous interviews  and reviewing available surveillance  video  after examining the evidence we have  determined the cause of the fire  on january 18th to be incendiary  meaning it was intentionally set and is  an act of arson  protecting the public is at the core of  atf's mission arson is a dangerous act  of violence  posing a significant threat to the  community  the fire caused extensive damage and  could have tragically resulted in  serious injury or loss of life  atf remains committed with our partners  to finding and bringing the perpetrator  of this crime to justice  as a result atf is offering a reward of  up to ten thousand dollars  for information leading to the arrest  and conviction  of the person or persons responsible for  setting this fire  we urge anyone with information  regarding this fire  to immediately contact atf at one  eight fire  atf tips at atf.gov  or through reportit.com  on behalf of atf and our partners i want  to thank the public in advance for any  information or help they can provide us  for this investigation  thank you  uh we'll take limited questions what  we'd like to do is uh  invite everyone uh all the cameras if  you want to get some b-roll we'll  we'll uh answer some individual  questions why don't we get out of the  inclement weather  i don't know if it's gonna rain again  we'll come over here to their atf's  command post  and we'll answer any questions over  there  yes the last name is g o r  m a n first name patrick  p-a-t-r-i-c-k  thank you very much
 

